@startuml getTcpClientConnectionInfoAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getTcpClientConnectionInfoAsync – Retrieve TCP Client Connection Info
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "TCP Client interface" as tcr #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - operationClientUuid
end note

requestor -> tcr: (operationClientUuid)
activate tcr

tcr -> jd: read logical-termination-points
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> tcr: LTP lists (operation-client, http-client, tcp-client)
deactivate jd

note over tcr
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Resolve HTTP client UUID from operation-client UUID  
  - Resolve TCP client UUID from HTTP client UUID  
  - Read TCP client attributes:
      * protocol  
      * ip-address  
      * port  
  - Construct full connection URL  
    (e.g., protocol://ip:port)  
  - Return connection URL  
  - Return undefined if resolution fails
end note

tcr --> requestor: fullConnectionUrl | undefined
deactivate tcr

@enduml
